Package: aftResearchCode
Type: Project
Title: Factor-Adjusted Smoothed Rank Estimation for High-Dimensional AFT Models
Version: 0.17.0
Authors@R: c(person("Weineng", "Zhu", role = "aut"), person("Yang", "Ju", role = "aut"))
Description: Source-based research software for factor-adjusted smoothed Gehan
    estimation, partially penalized optimization, fixed-active-face refinement,
    and frozen training-validation mappings. Includes deterministic examples
    and numerical checks. Load with scripts/load_project.R.
